{"games":[{"id":10675066724,"name":"Slime Tower Tycoon [NEW!]","desc":"Welcome to Slime Tower Tycoon! In this game, you'll build an awesome tower full of different slimes & sell their droplets to earn coins! There's no limit to how many slimes you can earn!\r\n\r\n🏰 Build an infinite tower full of cute slimes! (Auto-merges at 175 individual slimes to avoid lag)\r\n\r\n💸 Buy new slimes & upgrade your cauldron to climb the leaderboard!\r\n\r\n✨ Merge slimes into rarer versions that give you extra droplets!\r\n\r\nScripting, Slime Models, UI: Sir_Falstaff\r\nEnvironment Design: TipToesTim\r\n\r\nCreated by one of the developers of OOF Tycoon! ","path":"/game/10675066724-slime-tower-tycoon","slug":"10675066724-slime-tower-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3624a92a2f70aeebd1d139b90cb10487a8d1ab7f0492865472f024d357e213d6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b25db10c5d2881cead221912a15187a4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":7,"visitor":36287995,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-04-16T15:01:07.681Z","creator":{"name":"Babble Games - Merge Tycoons","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":14028946967,"name":"📉 Cart ride to save canny cat [PONZI SCHEMES!]","desc":"a remake for crtscc is in the works, stay tuned\n\nCore mechanics inspired by \"Cart ride around a 75kw diesel generator\". it should be in similar experiences go check it out too\n\nThe evil 🐈‍⬛ uncanny cats have kidnapped 🐈 canny cat and put him at the end of a perilous cart ride. Grab a cart and go save your kitty!\n\nControls/Tips:\n\nCTRL to shiftlock\nLMB or DOUBLE TAP to pick up unanchored part (such as a cart)\nSHIFT + WASDQE or ROTATE BUTTON + JOYSTICK to rotate currently held part\n\nTo start the game, pick up a cart and place it on the rails, then click the green button to start the cart. Make sure to look out for traps along the way! \nRemember that if your cart derails, you can jump out and drag it back into place. \n\nBuilding and electrical signals in this game can be confusing at first. Just remember that only parts which are glued together will transfer signals, and don't be afraid to ask experienced players for help. \n\nHave fun! 💥💥💥","path":"/game/14028946967-cart-ride-to-save-canny-cat","slug":"14028946967-cart-ride-to-save-canny-cat","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/731d06c28a16051d8aa224abd7738767121bc30c75a993c20c788fe41eb033b9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ab9a30c5928bcf53b5e9033807f78701/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":7,"visitor":1661266,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-22T04:04:25.637Z","creator":{"name":"Acetaldehyde (2, 4-dinitrophenyl) hydrazone Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":92173115378522,"name":"[🌊] Split The Sea","desc":"🌊 UPDATE PART 4\n\nNew obstacles for maps\nDouble jump is here — upgrade it along with speed!\n\n🔱 Wield the Poseidon Rod and split the sea! Race against the clock to dive into the depths and haul back as much loot as you can before the waves come crashing back together.\n🍀 Discover 1000+ possible loot variations — treasure chests, pearls, ancient debris, gems, and more. Collect with your friends and build your hoard!\n\n🦯 HOW DO I SPLIT?\n\nTap/Click to charge up your rod and tear the ocean apart!\n\n⭐ Remember to join the group and send feedback!","path":"/game/92173115378522-split-the-sea","slug":"92173115378522-split-the-sea","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e4a3055c95595dd8479a9209f5f01e374308caca33ebd811c13e4455062d8c25.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1e4dcbd86bb109faae167b8be549aac5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":7,"visitor":8020069,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-03T05:41:56.227Z","creator":{"name":"Simple and Fiya","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15055025587,"name":"[✨UPDATE✨] Egg Tree Incremental","desc":"Welcome to Egg Tree Incremental